{
    "_comment": "Mideye Shield iApp settings definitions. Each entry describes one configurable variable shown in the iApp UI. The 'name' is the static variable suffix used in RULE_INIT of MIDEYE_SHIELD_COMMON (i.e. static::MIDEYE_SHIELD_<name>). The 'section' and 'field' together form the iApp variable name $::section__field, which is also the placeholder __section__field__ inside the iRule body. The generator cross-checks 'name' against the actual RULE_INIT declarations and warns on any mismatch.",

